# ─── Canonical site URL ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Single source of truth for metadataBase (app/layout.tsx), app/sitemap.ts
# and app/robots.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://anchor.norai.tech

# ─── Optional: Supabase auth (OAuth: Google + GitHub) ───────────────────
# Fully OPTIONAL. Leaving these blank keeps Anchorflow 100% functional — the
# workstation runs entirely client-side and sign-in shows a "not enabled"
# state. To enable: create a project at supabase.com, then paste the project
# URL and anon (public) key below. Never put a service-role key in this file.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
